OL,3,GNEWSA'Bin your gum' signage addresses
OL,4,Asticky issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrightly-coloured signs have been put
OL,7,Fup across a city centre urging people
OL,8,Fchewing gum to dispose of it
OL,9,Fresponsibly.
OL,11,FExeter City Council has positioned the
OL,12,Fpink 'Bin your Gum' signage on bins and
OL,13,Fposts to discourage people from
OL,14,Fthrowing it on pavements or roads.
OL,16,FIn July, the authority received a
OL,17,F#30,657 grant from the Chewing Gum Task
OL,18,FForce - a national unit established by
OL,19,Fthe government - to help clean up gum
OL,20,Fand reduce gum littering.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
