OL,3,GNEWSA'Bin your gum' signage addresses
OL,4,Asticky issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FCllr Ruth Williams said she hoped the
OL,7,Fsignage would be "a talking point" and
OL,8,Fwould "encourage people to change their
OL,9,Fbehaviour and bin their gum moving
OL,10,Fforward".
